      "message": "Ok, so the problem is that `java_sdk_library` creates the `droidstubs` module within its defaultable hook and the `droidstubs` module tries to create its `java_api_contribution` within its own defaultable hook but that is not called, presumably because the top down mutator that calls the defaultable hook doesn\u0027t visit the newly created `droidstubs` module.\n\nWhat is the reason for creating the `java_api_contribution` in the `droidstubs` module? Why not create it directly from the `java_sdk_library`?",
      "revId": "f9e305a8bc60d16e4fff06c9f65f9bc4f12bb6ef",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
